{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nostalgia of the tracks is back with even more excitement! The classic <strong>Top Racer Collection</strong>, which brings together <strong>three legendary racing games from the 90s</strong>, now receives brand-new content: the Top Racer Customs DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the first time in the history of the franchise, <strong>players can customize their cars</strong> in Top Racer 1, not only visually, creating a unique style for each machine, but also in performance, adjusting <strong>speed</strong>, <strong>acceleration</strong>, <strong>nitro power</strong>, and <strong>fuel capacity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it doesn\u2019t stop there: <strong>customized cars can be shared with other players</strong>. Who will be able to create the ultimate machine? This is <strong>your chance to build the perfect car</strong> for every track and challenge friends and rivals in adrenaline-fueled races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of that, <strong>four brand-new cars</strong> are making their debut exclusively in Top Racer 1, all inspired by <strong>iconic models from the 80s and 90s</strong> that left their mark on the roads of that era. A heartfelt tribute to retro car culture and to the passionate fans who made Top Racer a timeless success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main features of the Top Racer Customs DLC (for Top Racer 1):</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance tuning: speed, acceleration, nitro, and fuel capacity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 brand-new exclusive cars inspired by 80s and 90s icons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual customization for Top Racer 1 cars and the 4 new vehicles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online sharing of your creations with other players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to experience the ultimate version of Top Racer: nostalgia, speed, and now the freedom to design your dream machine. Relive the thrill, race like never before, and show your identity on the asphalt with Top Racer Customs!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800320?t=1760720689","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800320?t=1760720689","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800320/a62148f04d1f2cb25b0e799afb47b87ec41e10a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760720689","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800320/a62148f04d1f2cb25b0e799afb47b87ec41e10a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760720689","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2765900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nostalgia of the tracks is back with even more excitement! The classic <strong>Top Racer Collection</strong>, which brings together <strong>three legendary racing games from the 90s</strong>, now receives brand-new content: the Top Racer Customs DLC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the first time in the history of the franchise, <strong>players can customize their cars</strong> in Top Racer 1, not only visually, creating a unique style for each machine, but also in performance, adjusting <strong>speed</strong>, <strong>acceleration</strong>, <strong>nitro power</strong>, and <strong>fuel capacity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it doesn\u2019t stop there: <strong>customized cars can be shared with other players</strong>. Who will be able to create the ultimate machine? This is <strong>your chance to build the perfect car</strong> for every track and challenge friends and rivals in adrenaline-fueled races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of that, <strong>four brand-new cars</strong> are making their debut exclusively in Top Racer 1, all inspired by <strong>iconic models from the 80s and 90s</strong> that left their mark on the roads of that era. A heartfelt tribute to retro car culture and to the passionate fans who made Top Racer a timeless success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main features of the Top Racer Customs DLC (for Top Racer 1):</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance tuning: speed, acceleration, nitro, and fuel capacity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 brand-new exclusive cars inspired by 80s and 90s icons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual customization for Top Racer 1 cars and the 4 new vehicles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online sharing of your creations with other players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to experience the ultimate version of Top Racer: nostalgia, speed, and now the freedom to design your dream machine. Relive the thrill, race like never before, and show your identity on the asphalt with Top Racer Customs!</p>","developers":["QUByte Interactive"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2214000","name":"Top Racer Collection"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"heade